---
// Lets the owner add the editor and Inquiry dashboard to their phone's home screen as one app, which
// opens without the browser's address bar. Its scope is /admin/, so both pages stay inside the app.
// The icon is the favicon's arch on the cream background, generated once with sharp. Sveltia adds a
// manifest of its own to the editor page, but it comes after this one and browsers use only the first.
---

<link rel="manifest" href="/admin/manifest.webmanifest" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/admin/icon-180.png" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#183828" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="Likha Admin" />
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
<meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes" />
